Use pnpm. Run the tests with `pnpm test`.
Do not edit `src/generated/` by hand; it is regenerated by `pnpm codegen`.

Do not skip `pnpm install` after switching branches.
Run `pnpm build`, not `pnpm dev`, before committing.
Use `pnpm test`, not `pnpm test:watch`, in CI.
Run `pnpm test:ci` rather than `pnpm test` in CI.
